IMPORTANT -- SCOPE OF THIS LICENCE:

This CC BY 4.0 licence covers the COMPILATION ONLY. It does NOT relicense, and does not affect the
licence of, the underlying PMC Open Access source articles that the keyword strings in this
compilation were drawn from. Every row records its own source-article licence in the
`source_licence` column (`CC BY` or `CC0`) and the contributing PMC identifier(s) in
`source_pmcids_a`/`source_pmcids_b`; those source articles remain under their own original
licence terms regardless of this notice. See `PROVENANCE.md` for the full accounting (497 CC BY
source-pair provenance entries, 3 CC0).
